{'symbol': 'AEE', 'date': '2022-02-01 11:00:00', 'title': 'AMEREN ILLINOIS RECEIVES APPROVAL TO CONSTRUCT LOGAN COUNTY CONNECTOR PROJECT', 'text': 'LINCOLN, ILL., FEB. 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMEREN ILLINOIS, A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF AMEREN CORPORATION (NYSE: AEE), RECEIVED APPROVAL FROM THE ILLINOIS COMMERCE COMMISSION (ICC) TO PROCEED WITH THE CONSTRUCTION OF THE LOGAN COUNTY CONNECTOR PROJECT.'}